322	/**
323	 * Posts a comment on a live issue. Mentions written as `@handle` in the body
324	 * are resolved against the org's members here, so the stored row and the
325	 * `comment.created` payload agree on who was mentioned — the notification
326	 * fan-out reads that list rather than re-parsing the markdown.
